issue.body:
I have noticed some trouble with the "attitude_euler" function.

in both examples the quad is just standing still.

but with the "attitude_euler" function, the pitch and roll values are way off, at random intervals.

this is a build of commit: 578c70c37c, running on a raspberry pi 2.

example:
```
telemetry->subscribe_attitude_euler([](Telemetry::EulerAngle angle) {
        std::cout << angle << "\n";
});
