When i use the regular attitude message, it works fine.

example:
```
mavlink_passthrough->subscribe_message_async(MAVLINK_MSG_ID_ATTITUDE, [&](mavlink_message_t message) {
        mavlink_attitude_t attitude;
        mavlink_msg_attitude_decode(&message, &attitude);

       std::cout << attitude.pitch << "deg " << attitude.roll << "deg\n";
});
